00:08:27,760 --> 00:08:28,640
into.

298
00:08:38,440 --> 00:08:39,560
At the very beginning,

299
00:08:39,560 --> 00:08:40,360
when we first saw

300
00:08:40,360 --> 00:08:41,080
Chen Hewen,

301
00:08:41,080 --> 00:08:41,800
we always said

302
00:08:41,800 --> 00:08:43,000
he boxed himself in

303
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:44,280
with too many rules.

304
00:08:44,280 --> 00:08:45,600
But at this point,

305
00:08:45,680 --> 00:08:46,880
he just wants to

306
00:08:46,880 --> 00:08:48,040
say exactly

307
00:08:48,040 --> 00:08:48,960
what he is feeling

308
00:08:49,240 --> 00:08:50,640
in the moment.

309
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:51,680
Now he's

310
00:08:51,680 --> 00:08:52,720
comfortable

311
00:08:52,720 --> 00:08:53,880
just being himself.

312
00:08:53,880 --> 00:08:55,000
And everyone can see

313
00:08:55,000 --> 00:08:56,240
what he's really like.

314
00:08:57,160 --> 00:08:59,320
Even though this trio's

315
00:08:59,320 --> 00:09:00,280
dinner

316
00:09:00,280 --> 00:09:01,400
wasn't romantic at all...

317
00:09:01,800 --> 00:09:02,040
Right.

318
00:09:02,040 --> 00:09:02,520
But

319
00:09:02,520 --> 00:09:04,520
it was so nice to watch.

320
00:09:04,640 --> 00:09:05,800
Yeah, it felt so relaxed.

321
00:09:05,800 --> 00:09:07,040
I think

322
00:09:07,040 --> 00:09:08,160
understanding each other

323
00:09:08,160 --> 00:09:09,240
and speaking honestly

324
00:09:09,240 --> 00:09:10,000
also has this

325
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:10,880
sense of friendship.

326
00:09:10,880 --> 00:09:11,160
Yeah.

327
00:09:11,600 --> 00:09:12,440
It's really touching.

328
00:09:12,440 --> 00:09:13,320
I think Liang Xiaoyu

329
00:09:13,320 --> 00:09:14,600
is really good at figuring things out.

330
00:09:14,680 --> 00:09:15,600
What she wants to figure out

331
00:09:15,600 --> 00:09:16,640
is what's going on

332
00:09:16,640 --> 00:09:17,080
between her and Chen Hewen.

333
00:09:17,760 --> 00:09:19,640
She's great
at steering the conversation.

334
00:09:20,280 --> 00:09:21,880
Then she gets Chen Hewen talking.

335
00:09:21,880 --> 00:09:23,000
And what Chen Hewen says

336
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:23,920
is very clear too.

337
00:09:24,160 --> 00:09:24,400
He said,

338
00:09:24,400 --> 00:09:26,120
(Chen Hewen makes his feelings clear)
"My feelings have never changed."

339
00:09:26,520 --> 00:09:27,160
I think

340
00:09:27,160 --> 00:09:28,440
he made himself very clear.

341
00:09:28,440 --> 00:09:29,360
Yeah.

342
00:09:29,560 --> 00:09:30,240
And earlier,

343
00:09:30,240 --> 00:09:31,240
from what she saw on the boat,

344
00:09:31,240 --> 00:09:32,880
I think after spending time together

345
00:09:32,880 --> 00:09:34,120
and asking this question,

346
00:09:34,120 --> 00:09:34,600
she

347
00:09:34,600 --> 00:09:35,280
can start sorting out

348
00:09:35,280 --> 00:09:36,540
some of her own feelings.

349
00:09:36,540 --> 00:09:37,380
(Liang Xiaoyu already has her answer)
So I think she's

350
00:09:37,380 --> 00:09:39,200
a really smart girl.

351
00:09:39,400 --> 00:09:40,560
She has her own pace

352
00:09:40,560 --> 00:09:41,560
and her own way

353
00:09:41,560 --> 00:09:42,840
of finding her answer.

354
00:09:42,840 --> 00:09:43,800
I think that's

355
00:09:43,800 --> 00:09:44,600
really impressive.

356
00:09:45,120 --> 00:09:45,520
Very good.

357
00:09:45,520 --> 00:09:46,280
She knows what she's doing.

358
00:09:46,280 --> 00:09:47,200
I like her.

359
00:09:47,200 --> 00:09:47,680
Yeah.

360
00:09:48,120 --> 00:09:49,200
Next, let's see

361
00:09:49,200 --> 00:09:49,760
what Sun Bohan

362
00:09:49,760 --> 00:09:51,000
and Xing are up to.

363
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:52,400
Let's take a look.

364
00:09:55,180 --> 00:09:57,980
(Heart Signal Mini Scene)

365
00:10:28,420 --> 00:10:29,900
(Beijing)

366
00:10:29,920 --> 00:10:30,560
Beijing?

367
00:10:31,000 --> 00:10:31,760
Let's watch something sweet.

368
00:10:31,760 --> 00:10:32,940
(Hospitalized)

369
00:10:36,960 --> 00:10:37,720
Sun Bohan.

370
00:10:40,900 --> 00:10:42,460
(Sun Bohan)

371
00:10:42,480 --> 00:10:44,000
Hi, Xing.

372
00:10:45,420 --> 00:10:46,060
(Smiles)

373
00:10:46,080 --> 00:10:46,880
What're you doing?

374
00:10:47,560 --> 00:10:49,640
They took the needle
out of my neck today.

375
00:10:49,640 --> 00:10:51,000
So I can turn my head now.

376
00:10:52,200 --> 00:10:54,400
The needle by your neck?

377
00:10:54,400 --> 00:10:55,720
Yeah, it's out now.

378
00:10:55,720 --> 00:10:56,920
Does it hurt now?

379
00:10:56,920 --> 00:10:58,000
The anesthesia wore off.

380
00:10:58,400 --> 00:10:59,720
So you don't feel much now?

381
00:11:00,280 --> 00:11:01,920
(Wu Xingying)
I don't need the nutrition IV today.

382
00:11:01,920 --> 00:11:02,920
(Getting better)
I don't need it anymore.

383
00:11:03,320 --> 00:11:04,360
Are you drinking
nutrition powder instead?

384
00:11:05,440 --> 00:11:06,280
I asked the doctor.

385
00:11:06,280 --> 00:11:07,840
He said 100 milliliters of water

386
00:11:07,840 --> 00:11:09,400
with six scoops, right?

387
00:11:10,440 --> 00:11:12,880
I'll heat it to about 45 degrees.

388
00:11:13,440 --> 00:11:14,320
Then mix it.

389
00:11:14,320 --> 00:11:16,200
(Glances)
So thoughtful.

390
00:11:16,200 --> 00:11:17,480
One scoop is about...

391
00:11:17,480 --> 00:11:18,120
100 milliliters.

392
00:11:18,120 --> 00:11:18,400
Right.

393
00:11:18,400 --> 00:11:20,360
This cup's about 100 milliliters.

394
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:23,000
Why's he suddenly so chatty?

395
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:27,200
Can you walk around today, Xing?

396
00:11:27,480 --> 00:11:29,080
Yeah.

397
00:11:29,880 --> 00:11:31,520
The doctor told me to move more too.

398
00:11:31,520 --> 00:11:32,600
So you can't just sit

399
00:11:32,600 --> 00:11:33,520
or lie down all day, right?

400
00:11:33,520 --> 00:11:35,200
Yeah, I've probably been
sitting and lying down

401
00:11:35,200 --> 00:11:36,200
for too long.

402
00:11:36,200 --> 00:11:39,000
Let's walk around the hallway later.

403
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:39,240
Okay.

404
00:11:39,240 --> 00:11:40,000
We'll take it slow.

405
00:11:40,240 --> 00:11:42,160
I'll take you to see the river.

406
00:11:42,160 --> 00:11:44,520
You've explored
this whole place by now, huh?

407
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:46,680
I can see it from the window.

408
00:11:46,680 --> 00:11:47,080
Right.

409
00:11:48,440 --> 00:11:51,160
45 degrees is basically lukewarm.

410
00:11:51,800 --> 00:11:52,800
Let it heat up first.

411
00:11:52,800 --> 00:11:53,960
Just for a bit.

412
00:11:53,960 --> 00:11:55,440
Can he stop narrating everything?

413
00:11:55,440 --> 00:11:56,280
It's cute.

414
00:11:56,280 --> 00:11:56,800
It is cute.

415
00:11:56,800 --> 00:11:58,080
Cute.

416
00:11:58,400 --> 00:11:59,160
Do you feel

417
00:11:59,160 --> 00:12:01,080
any discomfort anywhere now?

418
00:12:01,080 --> 00:12:01,920
I feel much better.

419
00:12:01,920 --> 00:12:02,760
Much better?

420
00:12:03,920 --> 00:12:04,960
You can run and jump now.

421
00:12:06,360 --> 00:12:07,560
Maybe not that far.

422
00:12:07,720 --> 00:12:08,760
I'm kidding.

423
00:12:09,520 --> 00:12:10,360
Before you came,

424
00:12:10,360 --> 00:12:10,840
I was saying

425
00:12:10,840 --> 00:12:13,080
I should practice walking first.

426
00:12:13,080 --> 00:12:14,760
Does my walk look normal?

427
00:12:14,960 --> 00:12:16,160
If you don't walk for too long,

428
00:12:16,160 --> 00:12:17,640
your muscles start to weaken.

429
00:12:18,520 --> 00:12:20,080
You gotta eat properly from now on.

430
00:12:20,080 --> 00:12:20,920
(Reminding her)

431
00:12:20,920 --> 00:12:21,800
Here you go again.

432
00:12:21,800 --> 00:12:22,660
(Already acting like family)

433
00:12:24,320 --> 00:12:26,320
I'll try not to eat much
in front of you.

434
00:12:26,320 --> 00:12:26,840
I won't let you see.

435
00:12:26,840 --> 00:12:28,520
Otherwise, you'll crave it even more.

436
00:12:29,440 --> 00:12:29,880
Right?

437
00:12:30,200 --> 00:12:30,880
It's fine.

438
00:12:32,400 --> 00:12:33,560
Wanna go out?

439
00:12:34,560 --> 00:12:35,160
Yeah.

440
00:12:35,160 --> 00:12:36,400
You really wanna go out, huh?

441
00:12:37,400 --> 00:12:38,880
Once you're feeling better,

442
00:12:38,880 --> 00:12:40,480
we'll go out together again.

443
00:12:43,280 --> 00:12:44,600
Exactly 45 degrees.

444
00:12:44,840 --> 00:12:45,800
He even smelled it.

445
00:12:46,880 --> 00:12:47,960
Exactly 45 degrees.

446
00:12:49,560 --> 00:12:51,120
The scoop's inside.

447
00:12:51,800 --> 00:12:53,280
Do you have chopsticks?

448
00:12:53,800 --> 00:12:55,040
Or maybe some small tongs?

449
00:12:55,040 --> 00:12:55,800
I don't think so.

450
00:12:55,800 --> 00:12:57,840
Is there a scoop under the lid?

451
00:12:57,840 --> 00:12:58,600
There is.

452
00:12:58,600 --> 00:13:00,200
But if I grab it with my hand,

453
00:13:00,200 --> 00:13:01,080
that's not ideal.

454
00:13:01,600 --> 00:13:02,520
I've got alcohol wipes.

455
00:13:02,520 --> 00:13:04,880
I'll sanitize my hands first.

456
00:13:07,000 --> 00:13:08,280
I usually carry

457
00:13:08,280 --> 00:13:09,680
alcohol wipes with me.

458
00:13:10,720 --> 00:13:11,600
Who asked?

459
00:13:11,600 --> 00:13:12,280
Exactly.

460
00:13:12,560 --> 00:13:13,320
Who asked?

461
00:13:15,760 --> 00:13:16,920
Where are you, Mr. Scoop?

462
00:13:16,920 --> 00:13:18,840
(Where's Mr. Scoop?)
Come on out, Mr. Scoop.

463
00:13:18,840 --> 00:13:20,040
He talks to himself!

464
00:13:20,040 --> 00:13:21,680
But does he really need to narrate

465
00:13:21,680 --> 00:13:23,120
every single step?

466
00:13:23,120 --> 00:13:24,400
Some people always respond.

467
00:13:24,400 --> 00:13:25,720
He always gives a play-by-play.

468
00:13:26,400 --> 00:13:27,560
(Cracks up)
Is there a scoop in there?

469
00:13:27,560 --> 00:13:28,840
There should be.

470
00:13:28,840 --> 00:13:30,160
Otherwise, why would

471
00:13:30,160 --> 00:13:32,160
the doctor tell me six scoops?

472
00:13:32,520 --> 00:13:34,860
(Searching)
It's fine. I sanitized.

473
00:13:35,740 --> 00:13:36,900
(Laughs)

474
00:13:40,920 --> 00:13:42,040
I should've grabbed a chopstick.

475
00:13:42,040 --> 00:13:43,480
I don't think I should use my hand.

476
00:13:43,480 --> 00:13:44,200
Oh my gosh.

477
00:13:44,200 --> 00:13:45,200
This is so...

478
00:13:45,560 --> 00:13:45,920
It's here.

479
00:13:45,920 --> 00:13:46,640
I see it.

480
00:13:47,520 --> 00:13:48,520
Let me find the scoop.

481
00:13:48,520 --> 00:13:51,040
Powders like this usually come with one.

482
00:13:51,040 --> 00:13:52,280
See? Found it.

483
00:13:53,400 --> 00:13:54,120
There really is one.

484
00:13:54,120 --> 00:13:56,320
Yeah, stuff like protein powder

485
00:13:56,320 --> 00:13:57,560
usually comes with a scoop.

486
00:13:57,560 --> 00:13:59,640
(Adding nutrition powder)
He's like a little robot.

487
00:13:59,640 --> 00:14:00,040
Usually

488
00:14:00,040 --> 00:14:00,400
at this point,

489
00:14:00,400 --> 00:14:01,040
the "wife" would say,

490
00:14:01,040 --> 00:14:01,400
"Forget it!"

491
00:14:01,400 --> 00:14:02,520
"Move aside. I'll do it."

492
00:14:02,520 --> 00:14:03,520
It's like making formula for a baby,

493
00:14:03,520 --> 00:14:03,840
right?

494
00:14:06,820 --> 00:14:08,060
(Stirring)

495
00:14:14,120 --> 00:14:14,440
Xing,

496
00:14:14,440 --> 00:14:16,560
would it be easier to use a spoon

497
00:14:16,560 --> 00:14:18,760
(Asks softly)
or drink from the cup?

498
00:14:18,760 --> 00:14:21,560
I'll drink from the cup.

499
00:14:21,560 --> 00:14:22,000
Okay.

500
00:14:26,600 --> 00:14:27,600
It's so sweet.

501
00:14:27,600 --> 00:14:30,080
Tastes like they added sugar.

502
00:14:31,440 --> 00:14:31,880
Yeah.

503
00:14:31,880 --> 00:14:33,600
It probably needs some sugar.

504
00:14:33,600 --> 00:14:35,680
Your body's low on sugar right now.

505
00:14:37,760 --> 00:14:39,480
There's still a little left.

506
00:14:41,520 --> 00:14:43,000
(Makes sure she finishes it)
Sun Bohan's pretty attentive.

507
00:14:45,000 --> 00:14:46,920
Have you talked to Si today?

508
00:14:46,920 --> 00:14:47,720
Not yet.

509
00:14:47,720 --> 00:14:48,560
No.

510
00:14:48,880 --> 00:14:49,760
Do you miss Si?

511
00:14:50,880 --> 00:14:52,920
If she's having fun,
I don't need to miss her.

512
00:14:53,200 --> 00:14:54,960
She can just enjoy herself over there.

513
00:14:54,960 --> 00:14:57,320
Why does he
sound like he's talking to a kid?

514
00:14:57,320 --> 00:14:58,800
He's giving total dad vibes.

515
00:14:59,280 --> 00:15:00,200
Wanna go out and have fun?

516
00:15:00,760 --> 00:15:02,160
What'd you do today?

517
00:15:02,920 --> 00:15:04,520
There's still a little left, Xing.

518
00:15:05,080 --> 00:15:05,720
Okay.

519
00:15:09,800 --> 00:15:10,440
Xing,

520
00:15:10,440 --> 00:15:12,240
I'll pour you some rice water.

521
00:15:12,240 --> 00:15:12,520
Okay.

522
00:15:12,520 --> 00:15:13,000
Sound good?

523
00:15:15,380 --> 00:15:18,180
(Rice water prepared in advance)

524
00:15:18,480 --> 00:15:19,560
What're you having today?

525
00:15:19,560 --> 00:15:21,520
Just the water from the rice.

526
00:15:22,120 --> 00:15:23,560
The water from the rice.

527
00:15:24,480 --> 00:15:26,440
I'll bring you some rice water tomorrow.

528
00:15:26,440 --> 00:15:26,960
Nice.

529
00:15:28,360 --> 00:15:29,480
Take a sip first.

530
00:15:29,480 --> 00:15:30,920
If it's cold, give it to me.

531
00:15:30,920 --> 00:15:31,200
Okay.

532
00:15:31,200 --> 00:15:33,280
(Hands it over)
Then drink some water later.

533
00:15:34,360 --> 00:15:34,840
Is it cold?

534
00:15:35,480 --> 00:15:36,040
No?

535
00:15:36,520 --> 00:15:37,080
Good.

536
00:15:37,840 --> 00:15:38,600
When Sun Bohan gets older,

537
00:15:38,600 --> 00:15:39,840
is he gonna be super chatty?

538
00:15:40,720 --> 00:15:41,880
He seems like a total girl dad.

539
00:15:41,880 --> 00:15:42,920
Definitely a girl dad.

540
00:15:44,520 --> 00:15:45,400
Still thirsty?

541
00:15:45,400 --> 00:15:45,880
No.

542
00:15:45,880 --> 00:15:46,680
Really?

543
00:15:46,680 --> 00:15:47,320
Okay.

544
00:15:47,320 --> 00:15:48,200
I haven't seen

545
00:15:48,200 --> 00:15:49,160
this kind of nagging love in ages.

546
00:15:49,840 --> 00:15:51,000
Nagging love!

547
00:15:51,640 --> 00:15:52,960
Let's go for a walk.

548
00:15:52,960 --> 00:15:55,200
Okay, wait. I'll help you, Xing.

549
00:15:55,360 --> 00:15:55,840
I'm fine.

550
00:15:55,840 --> 00:15:57,500
(Helps her)
Oh my gosh.

551
00:15:57,920 --> 00:15:59,520
I've already practiced.

552
00:15:59,520 --> 00:16:00,880
You practiced already?

553
00:16:01,280 --> 00:16:02,680
You can hold onto me.

554
00:16:02,680 --> 00:16:03,840
Or I can hold onto you.

555
00:16:03,840 --> 00:16:05,440
Okay, I'll hold onto you.

556
00:16:05,440 --> 00:16:06,700
(Links arms)
Okay.

557
00:16:06,720 --> 00:16:08,200
I'll take you to see the river.

558
00:16:08,200 --> 00:16:08,600
Okay.

559
00:16:09,480 --> 00:16:10,600
So when you walk now,

560
00:16:10,600 --> 00:16:13,520
(Walking slowly)
you have to go slowly, right?

561
00:16:13,520 --> 00:16:14,240
Don't go too fast.

562
00:16:14,240 --> 00:16:15,440
If you go too fast,

563
00:16:16,600 --> 00:16:17,720
it gets pretty uncomfortable.

564
00:16:17,720 --> 00:16:19,560
They're like an old married couple now.

565
00:16:20,560 --> 00:16:21,640
But it's getting late.

566
00:16:21,640 --> 00:16:22,840
We might not see it.

567
00:16:22,840 --> 00:16:23,960
Don't stand by the window.

568
00:16:23,960 --> 00:16:25,600
It's drafty. You might get cold.

569
00:16:25,620 --> 00:16:27,240
(Checking on her)
Are you hot?

570
00:16:28,440 --> 00:16:28,960
I'm okay.

571
00:16:28,960 --> 00:16:29,920
You're okay?

572
00:16:30,680 --> 00:16:32,080
He's really treating her
like a treasure.

573
00:16:33,000 --> 00:16:33,920
We can't see it.

574
00:16:33,920 --> 00:16:35,360
Here. You can see it from here.

575
00:16:36,240 --> 00:16:38,480
We drive in from here

576
00:16:38,480 --> 00:16:40,220
(The road to the hospital)
and park in that lot over there.

577
00:16:40,360 --> 00:16:41,120
Last night,

578
00:16:41,120 --> 00:16:42,280
my producer and I

579
00:16:42,280 --> 00:16:43,280
stayed here.

580
00:16:43,280 --> 00:16:45,520
We put the star projector in the middle

581
00:16:45,520 --> 00:16:46,880
and lay there watching the stars.

582
00:16:46,880 --> 00:16:48,520
I can show you later tonight.

583
00:16:48,520 --> 00:16:49,440
Let's do it

584
00:16:49,440 --> 00:16:50,640
when it gets darker.

585
00:16:52,080 --> 00:16:53,160
Are you cold, Xing?

586
00:16:53,640 --> 00:16:54,400
I'm okay.

587
00:16:54,400 --> 00:16:55,120
