I'm worried the rain'll get worse.

1751
00:59:59,080 --> 00:59:59,880
But it's fine.

1752
00:59:59,880 --> 01:00:00,640
You weren't there that day.

1753
01:00:00,640 --> 01:00:02,200
But you're here now.
That's what matters.

1754
01:00:03,320 --> 01:00:04,720
Look at him.
He finally said the right thing.

1755
01:00:04,720 --> 01:00:05,760
I...

1756
01:00:05,760 --> 01:00:06,720
You're so sweet.

1757
01:00:06,840 --> 01:00:08,720
I'm just really emotional right now.

1758
01:00:08,720 --> 01:00:09,560
What happened?

1759
01:00:09,840 --> 01:00:10,360
I'm kind of...

1760
01:00:10,360 --> 01:00:10,780
(Confidential)

1761
01:00:11,000 --> 01:00:12,040
A letter.

1762
01:00:12,040 --> 01:00:12,920
Who wrote it?

1763
01:00:13,860 --> 01:00:29,260
(Heart Signal (China Version) S9,
Finale Schedule)

1764
01:00:40,500 --> 01:00:43,220
♪Morning steam rises
from breakfast stalls♪

1765
01:00:43,220 --> 01:00:45,820
♪Packed subway cars,
barely room to breathe♪

1766
01:00:45,820 --> 01:00:50,020
♪Still half asleep, another day begins♪

1767
01:00:51,180 --> 01:00:53,900
♪The city glows beneath the towers♪

1768
01:00:53,900 --> 01:00:56,540
♪Somewhere beyond the clouds,
a sweet little date awaits♪

1769
01:00:56,540 --> 01:01:00,620
♪But first,
there are endless meetings to survive♪

1770
01:01:01,340 --> 01:01:02,740
♪Even if the fairy tale
only lasts a day♪

1771
01:01:02,740 --> 01:01:04,060
♪I'll still give it everything I have♪

1772
01:01:04,060 --> 01:01:05,380
♪Love out loud♪

1773
01:01:05,380 --> 01:01:06,780
♪Don't let this summer slip away♪

1774
01:01:06,780 --> 01:01:08,020
♪Cupid's arrow is already on its way♪

1775
01:01:08,020 --> 01:01:09,420
♪Don't act like you didn't see it♪

1776
01:01:09,420 --> 01:01:12,380
♪Just be a little braver♪

1777
01:01:12,380 --> 01:01:13,620
♪Keep moving♪

1778
01:01:13,740 --> 01:01:15,220
♪Keep moving♪

1779
01:01:15,220 --> 01:01:18,580
♪There's a little spark shining
in your eyes♪

1780
01:01:20,940 --> 01:01:23,300
♪That's the signal
of a heart coming alive♪

1781
01:01:33,740 --> 01:01:36,540
♪Keep moving♪

1782
01:01:36,540 --> 01:01:39,180
♪Life can be complicated,
yet beautifully simple♪

1783
01:01:39,180 --> 01:01:41,820
♪Go discover♪

1784
01:01:41,820 --> 01:01:44,500
♪That heartbeat you've been longing
to let out♪

1785
01:01:44,500 --> 01:01:47,180
♪Come closer♪

1786
01:01:47,180 --> 01:01:50,580
♪There's a little spark shining
in your eyes♪

1787
01:01:53,020 --> 01:01:55,820
♪That's the signal
of a heart coming alive♪
